### Prijava kao FULL
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}

> {% client.global.set("access", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Prijava kao READONLY
# @name loginRo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "citatelj", "password": "citatelj123"}

> {% client.global.set("accessRo", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 1. Popis svih oznaka - READONLY smije
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

### 2. Pretraga po pojmu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags?term=urgent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

### 3. Stvaranje kao READONLY - ocekivano 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"name": "ne-smijem", "color": "blue"}

### 4. Stvaranje kao FULL - ocekivano 201 + Location
# @name stvori
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"name": "nova-oznaka", "color": "blue", "notes": "iz custom API-ja"}

> {% client.global.set("tagId", response.body.id); %}

### 5. Dohvat jedne
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 6. Izmjena - ocekivano 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tags/{{tagId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"name": "izmijenjena-oznaka", "color": "green", "notes": "nakon PUT-a"}

### 7. Prazno ime - ocekivano 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"name": "  "}

### 8. Nepostojeci id - ocekivano 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 9. Brisanje kao READONLY - ocekivano 403
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tags/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

### 10. Brisanje kao FULL - ocekivano 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tags/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}